{
  "_": "What the terminal scenes show. Each entry is to be the real output of a sandbox run, with the sandbox folder written as the invented person's own folder (C:\\Users\\alex, /Users/alex). An entry marked draft is a placeholder written before the command existed: it renders with a DRAFT mark, and tools/render.js refuses a final render while any remain.",
  "install": {
    "draft": true,
    "title": "Terminal, on DESK",
    "prompt": "C:\\Users\\alex>",
    "steps": [
      {
        "cmd": "node install.js",
        "out": [
          "WilsonWorks Workspace: what this will do on DESK",
          "+ Hub        C:\\Users\\alex\\Hub, 7 zones, CLAUDE.md, NAV.md",
          "+ skills     12 starter skills, pinned",
          "+ office     every session on the Hub shows on the floor",
          "+ startup    the office starts when you sign in",
          "Go ahead? (y/n) y",
          "Done. Open your office: http://127.0.0.1:4316/"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
